\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 1. Executive Summary\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 FlexWord is a logic-based word puzzle game that evolves the standard "5-letter guessing" format into a comprehensive brain-training platform. Unlike competitors, FlexWord emphasizes 
\f0\b Accessibility
\f1\b0  (using distinct Shapes instead of just colors) and 
\f0\b Game Intelligence
\f1\b0  (using an algorithmic solver to provide dynamic hints and post-game analysis).\
This document outlines the 
\f0\b End Goal
\f1\b0  for the product. It bridges the gap between casual play and competitive logic puzzles, embodying the brand values of "Process Over Perfection" and "Age is Just a Data Type."\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 2. Core Pillars (The "Why")\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Accessibility First:
\f1\b0  We replace the standard Green/Yellow/Grey logic with 
\f0\b Circle/Triangle/Square
\f1\b0 . This is colorblind-friendly by default and creates a unique visual identity.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The "Flex":
\f1\b0  The engine handles variable word lengths (3, 4, 5, 6, 7, and 8), allowing users to "flex" their brain power as they improve.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Performance & Intelligence:
\f1\b0  Utilizing advanced bit-masking and pre-computed lookup tables to run a "Game Brain" locally on the device, offering privacy-first analysis without needing a server.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Visual Learning:
\f1\b0  A "Placeholder Key" and Drag-and-Drop functionality allow users to visualize potential words before committing to a guess.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

